# L §5.18: "A hole in F at any point the solver evaluates makes the result a hole carrying F's questions".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input xv: num
input target: num
def sq: num = xv * xv at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  xv = 1
  target = ?"target?"

ask a: solve sq == target for xv in [0, 4] to 1 law 2026-06-30
=== expect
a: ?"target?" (target)
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
